OL,3,GNEWSA'If everybody around us is eating
OL,4,Awhy can my baby not feed?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCould a simple sign in shop windows and
OL,7,Fpublic spaces help increase
OL,8,Fbreastfeeding rates?
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland has the lowest
OL,11,Fbreastfeeding rate in the UK, according
OL,12,Fto the Public Health Agency (PHA).
OL,14,FThere are now almost 1,500 venues and
OL,15,Forganisations across Northern Ireland's
OL,16,F11 council areas signed up to the
OL,17,FBreastfeeding Welcome Here scheme.
OL,19,FWhile some mothers are unable to
OL,20,Fbreastfeed - for medical reasons, for
OL,21,Fexample - others can face barriers
OL,22,Fincluding stigma and a lack of support.
OL,23,APub: 15-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
